{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1329,
  "batch_count": 1645,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "d2656fb43e00556ee3186c852692cfa26a722dbc",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:444ee54dfa84d669d4db2940",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我会赢的哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ed0d18e405f2fcad90d56249722fc14a43761bcd682dc6df460c40e59f12e327",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "71019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e1a7a9a02c22331c12e32cb0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "シュタタッと参上！\r\nどんな術でお世話しようかしら♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "b6c8f9bf97bfd114582de81d6c85805e506e4c9be304836c1b80313e792d8a65",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "71216"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:829cd23245823e2f05a1304e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ふふ、お世話心は忍ばせきれません♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "2cf422678fc75d84db702172b04327f6ece1eed8efd114ffe387a77ecd01f1e0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "71217"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:85f6f2ff4b5f79ee706d8d3b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "辛苦了",
      "source_fingerprint": "bd96bf364b8b21a3bb94efcf4ef82feb1bc34cf02203524e7949dbd19151dd13",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "80000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3a5a2303f384624f108548a2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我也要不辜负你的认真才行呢～",
      "source_fingerprint": "e17cbb7bde2a5d442a53573e51396a4b1b2307c17518ba2b64aa3abbc8075430",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "81000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bf0c75028377800aeb0740e0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呵呵呵，\r\n可不是这样就结束了哦～",
      "source_fingerprint": "3bf47ad4fd9453563256039ea334a9636c59c78649bc388ccadbb76f28fa555c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "81001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:69454c2fa0a32f652ffba330",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呵呵，训练员真是早起啊～\r\n吃过早餐了吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "36ac9c654e08abca7f8514da9d2afd1af91dd71f0a89233e9a7dda5342f560b2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "90000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:72bf08cc3a41fbcfefbf8f61",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "早安。\r\n哎呀，你的领子没有翻好……\r\n呵呵，我来帮你弄好吧～",
      "source_fingerprint": "c2c4bd7af6217e536ea243b8beec447f82934cb832bad0eb0c61fe7c67b72b14",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "90001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f6470b1223dcc3c5bd02dc84",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "已经这个时间了……\r\n我有做了便当来哦，一起吃午餐吧～",
      "source_fingerprint": "42d38f8382c4fecda7b5d396e435947bc0b4f3dec5ad4e2b1dc74cb1ab948d8c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "90002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:68b00ad7479ca09fa014b8d7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "为了下午也能好～好地训练……\r\n要不要先睡个午觉？",
      "source_fingerprint": "3e2e764855843b564f5d180eab59c1b5dc766ca851dffbbd9528b7fd3266c8ac",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "90003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:11c93ef6054887518259b9cd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天一整天也辛苦了～\r\n奖励努力的你，给你摸摸头♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "02e5549a4197f874abe1951cfd1edcc6c83b494d21a542c4510a662c38d4ee6e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "90004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bf4fe3b83000c328613fd51b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哎呀哎呀，训练员。\r\n这么晚还在工作吗？\r\n要不要帮你准备夜宵呢～",
      "source_fingerprint": "d1ddf42d6c0c61a6627d6dde3636ea67a8448a28e56143668cf93a0237e08f3f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "90005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3422930d9e9a64f1d5f30e38",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "大家一起赏花的话，\r\n只准备一两个重箱是不够的。\r\n呵呵，今年还是准备两倍的量吧♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "d49c87192788db24d2d77965994b42284106a9aaf6746f0d5a3a844a92d9a2ec",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "90006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2caaec776bb79bfff2cf072a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "睡觉的时候有没有露出肚子啊～？\r\n我常常帮托儿所的小朋友盖被子呢～",
      "source_fingerprint": "ef87038d39faf3d1b25b79e0899ed6782e8b31bd87be375cf9300175b0b81a8a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "90007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:986df79523e2137b72bb524b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "感觉秋天特别短暂呢。\r\n天气瞬间就会转冷了，\r\n想要织东西的话就要趁现在了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f88ac783511d0fb9fedf3e801d7d8d41c3f1f8d72cee0d13b0044219dc70c322",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "90008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:54e63a2f54be702c24733d1e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我常常被说手很温暖哦～\r\n所以，如果你忘了带手套\r\n就牵我的手吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "eeab2f9aa9a7ad460f7ce0bdf02343e65b87238bb8dcddf5ce95f8bea96f67ea",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "90009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:88f476615bb6d361d2bf3059",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这么早就醒来了呢。\r\n可以再好～～～好地\r\n多睡一点也没关系喔。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ad06a3843c757791067a6c54290b15c77209625c116ae0e66742a2191350a18b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "90010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:baf8b6097c9a8f7460f8d39b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "吃早餐前先去洗脸吧。\r\n来，毛巾给你……啊，\r\n这是绷带呢！呵呵。",
      "source_fingerprint": "240693e6539b84fac09a7881de14962dcd2d3454c96a24e932e970a913fe1dc3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "90011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:01fd69399bc07f4b2b7be2a3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "午餐有用南瓜做的\r\n汤、焗烤、布丁……\r\n呵呵呵，满满都是南瓜♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "3ba62bed9a6aeac76a5c62197ca3f56a038f76ea03e7a9821cbeeb52a2dd1685",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "90012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:631237e43778bb0684bea577",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呼啊……啊，不好意思。\r\n打扮成这个样子，\r\n就觉得白天很想睡觉……",
      "source_fingerprint": "d6f79ba7cc588650c1057bbe59b95af94907ea638bec5b0287a437ac77442cc4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "90013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6864ea22e303c9300402e4dc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不给人照顾就捣蛋～\r\n不让我好好照顾的话，\r\n就会恶作剧喔♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "6295bc8fff3affc0e494af6078b98b75cabf71f0e9827d82fa15c0c0e3261825",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "90014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1fa632faee968dc80af6c61b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "有吃了很多甜食吗？\r\n那么，\r\n和我一起刷牙吧～",
      "source_fingerprint": "3a2d32372d0615bf92d774f986a21e6f93642e364ac7d1d17ddf5fbff6d7b170",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "90015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a2594fc16fad89d1d17817c0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "春天是萌芽的季节。\r\n万物苏醒，就连一直沉睡的\r\n木乃伊都……开玩笑的♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "beed8ec2d7527ab429703a51e17924b85fb8be4029d2bfa18390ecc740fe912d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "90016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4ec594886449466ffe82a2c4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好像有很多孩子害怕\r\n木乃伊四处徘徊的传闻……\r\n所以我今晚也要巡房并安抚他们！",
      "source_fingerprint": "557ad34e5f33e77a0412980f42a2b14eeb1e871aa4b30700bd813ddff83bc476",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "90017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3deb366b0297cf2d5cad6081",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "孩子们扮成各种角色\r\n又跑又跳……\r\n真想看看这样的运动会～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "28844c4d92767bfca7ae8eb072a967c84f7e0b31ec9da40d18804be5d19c5ce0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "90018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:52c040188bb8cce8654ecbb8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员要是太过干燥\r\n变成木乃伊的话……！\r\n……那我就会永远疼爱你喔♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "34a1fcd16330ba63f05912cd18128c1397d194c3e5f61dc992d51707360cbfb1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "90019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b5d372a25b8b66cfd9247f65",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "情人节快乐哦～",
      "source_fingerprint": "cebb867e93b65a8077e2176c8f6641dae359272817cc37b08c559a82fc96eec7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "90020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:402785fd87e8662b85493b3a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "情人节快乐哦～",
      "source_fingerprint": "cebb867e93b65a8077e2176c8f6641dae359272817cc37b08c559a82fc96eec7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "90021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3d3ab770332a981e7f80fd62",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "こっそり隠れるのが忍者ですけど、\r\n朝は元気な挨拶から始めないと～。\r\nなので…おはようございますっ♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "1cf5b9db4009512237f9bc19bd6f1f145da8932b289b081e1d2e59db2a3e1053",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "90210"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:554c5265d05ddd25f8444bd6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "あらあら、寝ぐせが…\r\n忍法・ぺったんの術で\r\n整えてあげましょうね～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "62183bc2bf8ccfe65725e7dae9265fbdd9cc16faf3d5e669d34dc2cbcde433db",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "90211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5a87619ed49bf49e2318cdf8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "お昼休みにチャンバラしたんです。\r\n託児所でよくやってるから、\r\nなんと私が勝っちゃいました～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "bdd66f87686b3331692bd546ab59ef323a3aa6f113cebf2c694f2f2bc5dd2bf7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "90212"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7b372e1450a70df0feddcffa",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "寮の子たちにお弁当を作りました♪\r\n手裏剣の形のにんじんをこっそり\r\n忍ばせたけど、気づくかしら～？",
      "source_fingerprint": "2290d485fe19d3c0958ef400e4323b002349708e84930a97f8af92930b85b674",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "90213"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:05dfecf8ad3b71997eef61f1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "1人で夜のお散歩は危ないですから\r\n忍者がしっかりお守りしますね～。\r\nほら、手を繋ぎましょう♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "cb739e92da8f4fe24553043cf2ae3f3c98c9e0ef11ed29ed8b57201dfb4a5abc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "90214"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e5e6213fc7acedc7a221fb5e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "夜更かしは、めっ、ですよ～？\r\n子守唄を歌ってあげますね。\r\nりん、ぴょう、とお～、しゃ～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "015771f0bcc81be0e23feb4e6a527a2b9bcd320f245ac81f7d26eb1820fdfcbd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "90215"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d357a80f2b9b14134cf83278",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "春の感謝祭の季節ですね～！\r\nいいこのみんなに、ムササビの術で\r\n空からいっぱい感謝を贈りたいです",
      "source_fingerprint": "bb9ef3026fae08ecb586afd992a6d0d81c352f5eeaad020e3024971df2a365f7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "90216"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d2f1f3e81a8cde97290bb51e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "縁日の射的なら任せてくださいね♪\r\n手裏剣で、えいえいって…\r\nあら？銃しか使えないんですか～？",
      "source_fingerprint": "98e7e422ecbe67827fb8b02258af3174b715a5bd24e4df6de7f6153361b896df",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "90217"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:62b5183338f77ae1d0756bba",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "落ち葉をた～～っくさん集めて、\r\n木の葉隠れの術！…なんて♪\r\nいつも隣にいますからね～？",
      "source_fingerprint": "08665ccc006a3449eea7e824b22e3183042f93bd7a7e6f56065e1648bb44d0a9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "90218"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:893c4336135d04cadfebd51e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "最近、託児所で忍者ごっこがブーム\r\nなんです。お外を元気に走り回れば\r\n寒さも気になりませんよ～。",
      "source_fingerprint": "eb53eb4f3c8779d561ba67b1efaf31bd510aea3e130a08e95ec06d57546a81ee",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "90219"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:250b1154b29ca84a0ceaabf7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ハッピーバレンタインですよ～",
      "source_fingerprint": "4c3c86afb425f14b18ffe9332e01920783c728845609f815dd9cff97a015c820",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "90221"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d7ee5c429a3ea5921761cc88",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "小玉真是的，\r\n又忘记把口袋里的卫生纸拿出来了。\r\n呵呵，洗衣服的时候要记得提醒她呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ee8dc15802ef82391a5f5d3e4ece6eeaa65e078db3cf8ac9df61b5361e440c51",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "91000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1419637f6606b91fc4e80bb6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "小栗每到一个新地方\r\n就会很容易迷路……\r\n带路的时候我都会牵着她的手哦～",
      "source_fingerprint": "c8f2cb692c2695ab5b8da6ebb55a7ecb7d029e43c5588a9bb4c11cb4ffa85be2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "91001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f03e358e389fdfd65c29d274",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我很擅长织东西哦。\r\n想象着对方收到时的表情，\r\n做起来就会觉得很愉快呢♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "1bb7129de319eb158e61c1d8bc99e3eda3ba7b3ae178d2865ae02b36256885c8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "91002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3cdcb3a9cab936a5855cb4bf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我知道你是个很努力的人，但是……\r\n有烦恼的时候不要自己独自承受，\r\n也让我一起分担吧～",
      "source_fingerprint": "1e4d763b5c10aae8c213ceb0bad7bf66b9ea0689086cde0d48b4fc413aee328a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "91003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a0398a84b2bd40995da4c1f6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "念绘本给托儿所的小朋友听的时候，\r\n是还需要加上演技的……哇啊～！\r\n呵呵，鬼来了哦～恐怖吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "91690653fad98360d13b34f85154023f7364418b72b24283260d2325c9e0c68c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "91004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9eecd91fec81af8dbab8a78c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这套衣服上充满着什么样的心意呢～\r\n呵呵，可不能辜负那些心意。",
      "source_fingerprint": "90a221e82aebfa6272e35d43c34ff7e72cd97f1092c59b6395bf70875a2bb797",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "91005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9f8fb6a5e178e5b3c9f43f2b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "居然可以穿着一样的衣服\r\n登上舞台……\r\n呵呵，要好好练舞才行呢～",
      "source_fingerprint": "c820fb5f577bf5bef1e853aebaebfd7965eeb3205c0561493a80905d0a821a99",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "91006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:264379aaf64e0421230b1766",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "无论是怎样的比赛都没问题的。\r\n只要有你的期望，平静安稳的溪流\r\n也能变成气势磅礡的大河。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7ee641aa097fc4160a88d3de58bfe52ec3a2ecc7b8c472d0137c6d2d3621c60d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "91007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ba70707d1bdbb7c7ec7e2ad6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "手帕、卫生纸、\r\n裁缝针线、外伤药……\r\n果然有包包还是比较方便呢～",
      "source_fingerprint": "f1f6920c0059a39ba3ae1f9a4cc2260dfe3525bee03622df04267b7e9872274e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "91008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1f2e7c804da71e0cd149d386",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "原本想要溺爱一下\r\n还没睡醒的训练员来着……\r\n呵呵呵，今天怎么了呢～？",
      "source_fingerprint": "7fb80c89b76530353bce87f05a4d4e7c5b029a8461d6c22c0cf81220aaf361c5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "91009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:67932a0aef7f288e9c008c39",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "下午的行程已经决定好了吗？\r\n啊，你不用着急哦～\r\n我们一起慢慢想吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7083c3c21a66967b76689eafabe2882bfb421cbad5837fc44b162561bcddfa6d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "91010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fb3b90f95da04e493be86e5e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "睡不着的时候我会为你唱摇篮曲的，\r\n不要客气尽管跟我说哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7c7f7bd673bd78e1a4ac72d079c473eb760cbe73e0d19d43e6e16100b5d177dd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "91011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:66e9c170aa80dc65533a4242",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "春天的朝气给人有种随时都会有\r\n开心的事情发生的感觉……\r\n呵呵，会感到很期待呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "795e633d4160f80ad16e4a68ce00a2f5e8eaf6243511f388ad046c9f5871e219",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "91012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:389dc80cfed8030cdda078e8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "夏天真的不能没有毛巾呢～\r\n因为有擦不完的汗水嘛……呼。\r\n还是干脆直接换衣服算了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f7218fadf2a45d5643b2c275e5547209145d2346eda18638a9450ed09b7d4b32",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "91013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:048874618737fa129e739b88",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "食欲、读书、运动……\r\n训练员觉得秋天最适合做什么呢？\r\n……该不会是想被宠爱的秋天？\r\n呵呵呵。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9ee155da1da4ea2f0a85e57af5b02cce879cb08be519afc8a56e79139c2cbabb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "91014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:893800c1b4d839ca6f10e503",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你有乖乖在戴手套吗？\r\n为了避免冻伤，\r\n一定要做好手的保暖哦～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "8ae400ba4b286147760daa8bafaf7408357f0bdf9302736622fc5e91ff6c33c1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "91015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:92593d6e4ddc6b4d903e82a1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "孩子们开心得到处跑来跑去……\r\n呵呵，万圣节\r\n是个很能照顾他人的节日呢～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "5562cb58e9eac71c5937fe362ccd3a5001d3909afa8419f32d3985c68bcf6d66",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "91016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:950957b4c9c988522987f33b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我喂每一个人吃点心后，\r\n被小玉说\r\n「这个万圣节也太奇怪了！」♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "8a554742247bb417c2c74765cf6babed202748abf55197bd1ea5a57287185bc4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "91017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bdad3440491e0ef082d548f0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "因为有小荒帮忙准备资料，\r\n才能完成这套服装。\r\n称赞她一次根本不够呢～",
      "source_fingerprint": "a8b422febbe432555dbc93084131a21318112b02554bd22939c5d601dc59e7c2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "91018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e00196ad84f1528cc6e10920",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "认真的小波总是很努力，\r\n非常可爱呢～\r\n让人很想称赞她♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "b61ed99ea89d1acdda5ff1bca44e19978396608939a653310b502777ed378b42",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "91019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2b42c289db7a86341998d1e0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "只要给米米点心，\r\n她就会高兴到眼睛发亮。\r\n得再准备点心才行♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "06fe507e70e0fa851dd960e0ad37e43576bb96e1456c8ad65b43cf092d8dbe17",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "91020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c03dad40c2a0e961f2fd91ac",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "如果做了恶梦\r\n还请尽管跟我说。\r\nMummy会好好安慰你的♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "83d3935e7bb76c262ee2d2bdecdd997802ae25047e69c455656c9448a914b078",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "91021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9f9d8dfe4c1510d306281b08",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然还没到吃点心的时间，\r\n但是……你可以先吃一个♪\r\n要对大家保密喔～",
      "source_fingerprint": "9b4c2201cbab84ee8070ec475c26d472d3af787ec11a55eb882f846c6b688525",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "91022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b1d7fcc7e44a4dd49f18da7b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "没有光线的地方\r\n似乎能睡得比较好。\r\n像是……棺木里面之类的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "52473ab97d7fdc2fff2553340b2b1288862341ec0c90a8e896e7d7a359d122a0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "91023"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:887e383bc4e9e5126928a78a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哎呀哎呀，好像困了呢～\r\n毕竟这个季节很舒适，\r\n请听我的摇篮曲尽管入睡吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2c3206d1e0955444061b24cd269b993feb50cdad2ec044e23222691001d8e10d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "91024"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7bcb9015d499330d37412578",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "对木乃伊来说也很炎热呢～\r\n有好好补充水分吗？\r\n我帮你拿水过来喔。",
      "source_fingerprint": "69cc2a391290a036951f09b73fd22a746e48a9432eae9677078969cf2a03cd33",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "91025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:94bf4ad40bdafea493dd3269",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员要变装的话……\r\n可以扮成妖怪或殭尸也很好……\r\n嗯～干脆全部都做一套吧♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "2f6f5d54f45a11c25bc020a8b19b555ca69f1bb97d4a211b9d25f942e6905328",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "91026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dcec62fdb26ad301147ab71d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "风好冷呢。\r\n把我的绷带当作围巾，\r\n要不要一起围在脖子上呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "f4b967c4c2da1f91f98723f4a9f2bee65d8ef909708119585f04162d1019d0dd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "91027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ca8cf8a72964d24531d82c09",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Mummy是永不消逝的存在。\r\n所以……\r\n可以永远照顾大家。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c61b68a3578a6547bfa33b20ec8740bb19e47f9d44b63f7a12a4353ae0417485",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "91028"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:976f664a872494670529bf81",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "受伤了还请告诉我。\r\n我的每一处绷带\r\n都可以尽情使用喔～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "0d9cfb0142b4110a8ec26b934828c32cc0ff2c370b5c613b56e178344de8245f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "91029"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c075c3ad45383f00ebe6c690",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "抜き足～差し足～…ふふ、隠れ身の\r\n術の特訓中なんです。照れ屋の子も\r\nこっそりお世話できたらなって♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "fac8ffdd6c62fe010f4fecf5e03f917c72a63a36c25d06d9823d2f8c03ced8f1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "91216"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cb32219b21a26d410f4515c0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "困り事はないでござるか？…ふふ、\r\n今度ヤエノちゃんと託児所で戦国\r\nショーをするので、役作りです♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "dab01878a664ab56bc6497bc160e20911a064d4e2f28560a23159fc5f5886158",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "91217"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d3c421f138dca9814769ace1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ノーリーズンちゃん、尻尾の毛並み\r\n整えてあげたら『苦しゅうない！』\r\nって♪ふふ、やりがいがあります～",
      "source_fingerprint": "35e40d39bbe82e776b4c25f3f609ce63dbd0ca6718bcc875883893fd10aaa6b3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "91218"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d85d9e3982af4f2dfd5a24ad",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ミラ子ちゃん、いいこですよね～。\r\n私のことも、たまに『お母さん』\r\nって呼んでくれますし…かわいい♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "82ef603efd1c68a3f2c2de44118968b26adf41db5c39c18ece3e5bb8c0352391",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "91219"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7014576017b8b20b2bd3e25d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "タイシンちゃんがゲームに集中\r\nしてる時は忍び足。たまに小声で\r\n『よし』って言うのもかわいくて♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "c0fb092760d9e85236c6570fe22b81f8407e157ed91e9402407a8339f593cf22",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "91220"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dc282374b47b4e6d5f06688d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "まんまるお団子ヘアーですよ～。\r\nかわいく仕上がるのが嬉しくて、\r\n朝の準備も楽しみなんです♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "764a76b8a6295c65ff708c342152a47d26cb62d762eb7e119f43c462dd0f794b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "91221"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e1ee7214063358b4388e0090",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "午後のおやつは何を食べたい\r\nですか？飴におもちに金平糖…\r\n巾着袋に色々ありますからね♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "67721d6a958d3e2316a3b0da7f76d7717eaa69bc6c6b6be81707fc04c375853d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "91222"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dc552a608a12831558b8b93d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "まあっ！おやすみの前に会いにきて\r\nくれたんですか？いいこいいこ～。\r\n明日も元気な顔を見せてください♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "e94a0deb975e6e8a4a7b73c533bc65c3fdc981b70bc6da0c2a1880904f421ba5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "91223"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:826c353b9cfa9810ba4cd3a3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "春の日差しを浴びたお布団に\r\n包まると安らぎますよね～。だから\r\n託児所では、毎日干すんですよ♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "801d31f0c6195439f2ed3e95891878ebe1e6c3e37f5daf3dc8b99151a29d8411",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "91224"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0ff140a0ad107bbb6dcc530a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "おでこの汗ふきふきしましょうか？\r\nあら？ほっぺたも真っ赤に…\r\nぱたぱたして冷まさないと～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "22f13f1da88117c3fdb602761a9c0f8fc3838681814ad82060b9be3112067f8a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "91225"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8c333375b6c75060d4880288",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "秋の夜長のお散歩も乙ですよね～。\r\nお月様に見守られながら、お手手を\r\n繋いで、のんびり、どこまでも～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "abf3e7fed8e96547126d84471b2aff5f7b10c0be9396adda7e78bc6d03f01b42",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "91226"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
